    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/d1346586b0ce9bb82c4d4a9320699ab4.avif?t=1695220888\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/d2b8fe3b169bbef192aaada96b417fac.poster.avif?t=1695220888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/d2b8fe3b169bbef192aaada96b417fac.webm?t=1695220888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/d2b8fe3b169bbef192aaada96b417fac.mp4?t=1695220888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Scribbler is a scholar who cannot remember his past while Patch is a unique breed of dragon, a \u00b4Chimeragon\u00b4, with new, unexpected powers they discover along the way.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/bf9388f9b0c20f1b6ebe4db7dd4a41bd.avif?t=1695220888\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/2e2a871c9b3cc1ca960b3270a62e694f.poster.avif?t=1695220888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/2e2a871c9b3cc1ca960b3270a62e694f.webm?t=1695220888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/2e2a871c9b3cc1ca960b3270a62e694f.mp4?t=1695220888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Join the new heroic duo, Scribbler, and Patch, in an epic battle to save dragons and defeat the villain, Eir, who is controlling dragons to carry out her evil plans. Clash against fierce enemies, explore new and familiar locations, meet many favorite DreamWorks Dragons characters, and recover the memories that reveal Patch\u2019s true origin in this fun and fiery action-adventure game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/40934a7312d4e86b1faadb7e4a34cf0e.avif?t=1695220888\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/270ef5032c3e1de3302a7bf84f28b15d.poster.avif?t=1695220888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/270ef5032c3e1de3302a7bf84f28b15d.webm?t=1695220888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/270ef5032c3e1de3302a7bf84f28b15d.mp4?t=1695220888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>A NEW ADVENTURE </strong>- Recover Scribbler\u2019s lost memories as you forge a friendship with Patch, his ultimate hybrid dragon<br></li><li><strong>BATTLE</strong> - Unlock powerful abilities and take on fearsome foes<br></li><li><strong>EXPLORE</strong>  - Fly to new and familiar locations including Havenholme, Valka\u2019s Mountain and Blood Briar Island <br></li><li><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong> - Swap between Scribbler and his dragon Patch to conquer obstacles</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/d1346586b0ce9bb82c4d4a9320699ab4.avif?t=1695220888\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/d2b8fe3b169bbef192aaada96b417fac.poster.avif?t=1695220888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/d2b8fe3b169bbef192aaada96b417fac.webm?t=1695220888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/d2b8fe3b169bbef192aaada96b417fac.mp4?t=1695220888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Scribbler is a scholar who cannot remember his past while Patch is a unique breed of dragon, a \u00b4Chimeragon\u00b4, with new, unexpected powers they discover along the way.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/bf9388f9b0c20f1b6ebe4db7dd4a41bd.avif?t=1695220888\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/2e2a871c9b3cc1ca960b3270a62e694f.poster.avif?t=1695220888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/2e2a871c9b3cc1ca960b3270a62e694f.webm?t=1695220888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/2e2a871c9b3cc1ca960b3270a62e694f.mp4?t=1695220888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Join the new heroic duo, Scribbler, and Patch, in an epic battle to save dragons and defeat the villain, Eir, who is controlling dragons to carry out her evil plans. Clash against fierce enemies, explore new and familiar locations, meet many favorite DreamWorks Dragons characters, and recover the memories that reveal Patch\u2019s true origin in this fun and fiery action-adventure game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/40934a7312d4e86b1faadb7e4a34cf0e.avif?t=1695220888\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/270ef5032c3e1de3302a7bf84f28b15d.poster.avif?t=1695220888\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/270ef5032c3e1de3302a7bf84f28b15d.webm?t=1695220888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/896960/extras/270ef5032c3e1de3302a7bf84f28b15d.mp4?t=1695220888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>A NEW ADVENTURE </strong>- Recover Scribbler\u2019s lost memories as you forge a friendship with Patch, his ultimate hybrid dragon<br></li><li><strong>BATTLE</strong> - Unlock powerful abilities and take on fearsome foes<br></li><li><strong>EXPLORE</strong>  - Fly to new and familiar locations including Havenholme, Valka\u2019s Mountain and Blood Briar Island <br></li><li><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES</strong> - Swap between Scribbler and his dragon Patch to conquer obstacles</li></ul>",
